<%#
  A webhook signing secret, shown the one time it exists in plaintext.

  Shared by /webhooks (after a create and after a rotate) and wizard step 8,
  so the three places an operator can be handed a secret all say the same
  thing, in the same shape, with the same copy control — the same idiom
  wizard/step6-api-key.ejs uses for a minted API key.

  It names the subscription. That is the whole reason this is a partial and
  not three blocks: a bare UUID beside a live credential gives an operator
  with several subscriptions no way to tell which endpoint it belongs to.
  Label, URL and tenant are what they recognise; the id is there for support.

  Locals:
    heading  what just happened, as a sentence fragment
    intro    one line of explanation under it
    secret   the plaintext — rendered as text, never into a URL, because
             req.url is not in LOG_REDACT_PATHS
    sub      { id, tenantId, url, label } — whichever are known
-%>
<div class="card" style="margin-top: var(--space-6); border-color: var(--accent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-muted) 50%, transparent)">
  <h2 class="card__title" style="margin-top: 0"><%= heading %></h2>
  <p class="muted" style="margin: 0 0 var(--space-3)"><%= intro %></p>

  <div class="eyebrow">Shared secret (HMAC-SHA256)</div>
  <div class="code-copy code-copy--block" style="margin-top: var(--space-2); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: var(--space-3); background: var(--surface-0)">
    <pre style="margin: 0; padding-right: 64px; word-break: break-all; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: var(--text-sm)"><code class="mono"><%= secret %></code></pre>
    <%# data-copy, not an inline onclick: layout.ejs delegates it at the
        document, so it also works inside the resource modal, where a view's
        own <script> never runs. The label says what is being copied — two
        copy buttons on one page otherwise both toast "Copied to clipboard". %>
    <button type="button" class="code-copy__btn" data-copy="<%= secret %>"
            aria-label="Copy the signing secret to the clipboard">
      <i class="ph ph-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i> Copy secret
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="muted" style="margin: var(--space-3) 0 0; font-size: var(--text-xs)">
    Verify each delivery's <span class="mono">X-OI-Signature: sha256=&lt;hex&gt;</span> header by
    HMAC-SHA256-ing the raw request body with this secret.
  </p>

  <p class="muted" style="margin: var(--space-3) 0 0; font-size: var(--text-xs)">
    <% if (sub.label) { %><strong><%= sub.label %></strong> · <% } %>
    <% if (sub.url) { %>url <span class="mono"><%= sub.url %></span> · <% } %>
    <% if (sub.tenantId) { %>tenant <span class="mono"><%= sub.tenantId %></span> · <% } %>
    id <span class="mono"><%= sub.id %></span>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="alert alert--warning" style="margin-top: var(--space-4)">
  <strong>Save the secret before navigating away.</strong>
  It is stored encrypted and cannot be shown again — rotate the subscription to mint a new one.
</div>
